CLASS Defender (or Attacker):

    SETUP:
        initialise all hardware (motors, sensors)
        create a StateManager instance
        create a CommunicationManager instance, passing it the StateManager
        start all sensor threads
        start CommunicationManager send/receive threads

    MAIN LOOP:
        read current state from StateManager

        IF state is IDLE:
            sit still, wait

        IF state is LOCATING:
            use IR data from StateManager to orient toward ball
            call driver to rotate / search

        IF state is RETRIEVING:
            drive toward ball using IR position data
            if colour sensor detects ball, set has_ball = True
            tell StateManager to transition to next appropriate state

        IF state is PASSING:
            align toward other robot using position data
            trigger pass mechanism
            update StateManager has_ball = False
            set request to NONE

        ... and so on for each state

    SENSOR THREADS:
        IR thread:
            continuously read IR sensor
            call state_manager.update_ball_position(angle, strength)

        Colour thread:
            continuously check for ball contact
            update state_manager.has_ball if changed

        Foul button thread:
            if pressed, call state_manager.transition_state(FOUL)